     Function.Injective.{u_2 + 1, u_1 + 1} f →\n        [inst : Add.{u_2} S] →\n          [inst_1 : Mul.{u_2} S] →\n            [inst_2 : Zero.{u_2} S] →\n              [inst_3 : One.{u_2} S] →\n                [inst_4 : SMul.{0, u_2} Nat S] →\n                  [inst_5 : Pow.{u_2, 0} S Nat] →\n                    [inst_6 : NatCast.{u_2} S] →\n                      [inst_7 : Semiring.{u_1} R] →\n                        Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f 0) 0 →\n                          Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f 1) 1 →\n                            (∀ (x y : S),\n                                Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f (HAdd.hAdd.{u_2, u_2, u_2} x y))\n                                  (HAdd.hAdd.{u_1, u_1, u_1} (f x) (f y))) →\n                              (∀ (x y : S),\n                                  Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f (HMul.hMul.{u_2, u_2, u_2} x y))\n                                    (HMul.hMul.{u_1, u_1, u_1} (f x) (f y))) →\n                                (∀ (n : Nat) (x : S),\n                                    Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f (HSMul.hSMul.{0, u_2, u_2} n x))\n                                      (HSMul.hSMul.{0, u_1, u_1} n (f x))) →\n                                  (∀ (x : S) (n : Nat),\n                                      Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f (HPow.hPow.{u_2, 0, u_2} x n))\n                                        (HPow.hPow.{u_1, 0, u_1} (f x) n)) →\n                                    (∀ (n : Nat), Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f ↑n) ↑n) → Semiring.{u_2} S","unsafe":false,"value":446,"source":{"code":"/-- Pullback a `Semiring` instance along an injective function. -/\n-- See note [reducible non-instances]\nprotected abbrev semiring [Semiring R] (zero : f 0 = 0) (one : f 1 = 1)\n    (add : ∀ x y, f (x + y) = f x + f y) (mul : ∀ x y, f (x * y) = f x * f y)\n    (nsmul : ∀ (n : ℕ) (x), f (n • x) = n • f x) (npow : ∀ (x) (n : ℕ), f (x ^ n) = f x ^ n)\n    (natCast : ∀ n : ℕ, f n = n) : Semiring S where\n  toNonUnitalSemiring := hf.nonUnitalSemiring f zero add mul nsmul\n  __ := hf.nonAssocSemiring f zero one add mul nsmul natCast\n  __ := hf.monoidWithZero f zero one mul npow","start":144,"end":152},"axioms":["propext"]}